cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "readcon-db: mmap CON corpus store with multi-language bindings"
message: "If you use readcon-db, please cite it using the metadata below. The CPC manuscript is the readcon-core article; this record is the companion campaign-store software, not a second paper."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Rohit
    family-names: Goswami
    email: rgoswami@ieee.org
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2393-8056"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/lode-org/readcon-db"
version: 0.1.5
date-released: "2026-08-15"
keywords:
  - CON
  - LMDB
  - trajectory
  - molecular dynamics
  - campaign store
abstract: >-
  readcon-db is the companion campaign store for the readcon-core CON
  interchange. It keeps CON text as the authoritative blob in an LMDB
  corpus with secondary indexes (energy, formula, section presence) and
  an optional derived RCSO cache. The Computer Physics Communications
  manuscript is the readcon-core article; this record is software, not a
  second paper.
